/-!
# A checked displacement rank in the literal candidate family

Two explicit binary row expansions and an identity pivot minor certify rank
50 for the displacement of the fifteenth (zero-based) PC generator. The input
matrix is the producer's checked original-basis evaluation. The final theorem
applies this certificate to coordinate one of the second candidate subgroup.

Generated witnesses are not trusted: every row equation and pivot is checked
by Lean's kernel. The generator is in source/generate_pc15_rank.py.
Source context: Aschbacher–Smith A.3.12, pp.47–48; Kleidman–Wilson (1988),
pp.484–510. ATLAS matrix attribution is retained in Janko4.Model.Data.
-/

